{"type":"message","id":"4e3b858a","parentId":"3bf8ff5e","timestamp":"2026-02-25T03:53:19.925Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_703a434a92f34e1bb2644b20","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: cron-scheduler\ndescription: Schedule and manage periodic tasks using cron-like scheduling\nmetadata:\n  clawdhub:\n    emoji: \"⏰\"\n    requires:\n      bins: [\"python3\"]\n---\n\n# Cron Scheduler\n\nSchedule periodic tasks using cron syntax. Supports one-time and recurring tasks.\n\n## Features\n- Schedule tasks using cron syntax\n- One-time and recurring scheduling\n- Task status monitoring\n- Execution logging\n\n## Usage\n```bash\n# Schedule a daily task at 18:00\ncron-scheduler --schedule \"0 18 * * *\" --command \"powershell\" --args \"-File D:\\\\666666_kingwork\\\\tools\\\\daily_cleanup.ps1\"\n\n# List scheduled tasks\ncron-scheduler --list\n\n# Remove a task\ncron-scheduler --remove <task_id>\n```"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771991599923}}
