        \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13            518 SECURITY.md"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":318,"aggregated":"??: C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\openclaw-memory-final\r\n\r\n\r\nMode                 LastWriteTime         Length Name                                                                 \r\n----                 -------------         ------ ----                                                                 \r\nd-----         2026/2/25     14:13                .github                                                              \r\nd-----         2026/2/25     14:13                docs                                                                 \r\nd-----         2026/2/25     14:13                examples                                                             \r\nd-----         2026/2/25     14:13                scripts                                                              \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13            183 .editorconfig                                                        \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13             64 .gitignore                                                           \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13           1223 CHANGELOG.md                                                         \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13           1074 CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                                                   \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13            824 CONTRIBUTING.md                                                      \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13           1086 LICENSE                                                              \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13           4076 README.md                                                            \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13           3966 README.zh-CN.md                                                      \r\n-a----         2026/2/25     14:13            518 SECURITY