{"type":"message","id":"d3aa6d80","parentId":"8d8469ce","timestamp":"2026-02-25T15:47:18.802Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                          很好！MCP服务器正在运行。让我尝试直接调用工具。根据README，应该使用`claw_get_bookmarks`工具。\n\n大王，MCP服务器正在运行，但需要浏览器扩展完成授权连接。请：\n\n1. **打开Chrome浏览器**\n2. **点击右上角OpenClaw扩展图标**  \n3. **点击\"扩展设置\"**\n4. **输入Gateway Token：`Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`**\n5. **点击\"立即授权\"**\n6. **刷新任意网页并点击扩展图标attach**\n\n完成授权后，我就能使用`claw_get_bookmarks`查看收藏夹分类了！ 🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":88991,"output":161,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89152,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772034415413}}
