{"type":"message","id":"d0ae6892","parentId":"0c46130e","timestamp":"2026-02-25T15:59:02.669Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                                                                        大王，我已经完成了浏览器扩展的状态显示功能修改！ 🎯\n\n## ✅ 修改完成\n\n### 🔴 状态显示系统\n- **OFF** (红色)：未授权/未连接\n- **…** (黄色)：连接中  \n- **ON** (绿色)：已连接/可调用\n- **!** (橙色)：故障/错误\n\n### 📋 主要修改\n1. **更新badge颜色配置** - 符合你的颜色规范\n2. **统一标题管理** - 通过setBadge函数自动设置对应标题\n3. **移除所有硬编码标题** - 避免状态不一致\n4. **添加初始化函数** - 扩展启动时设置所有标签页初始状态\n\n### 🚀 使用步骤\n1. **重新加载浏览器扩展**\n2. **扩展将显示颜色状态标识**\n3. **点击扩展图标进行授权连接**\n4. **观察状态颜色变化**\n\n扩展现在会有清晰的状态视觉反馈，让你一眼就知道连接状态！ 🎨"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":88757,"output":217,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88974,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772035125413}}
{"type":"message","id":"c99082c5","parentId":"d0ae6892","timestamp":"2026-02-25T15:59:30.627Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"39910884-f1ae-4df9-84c9-1fe409ebaf15\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Wed 2026-02-25 23:59 GMT+8] 看看哪里还有问题 这是插件里面内置的使用说明 1. 确保 OpenClaw Gateway 或 MCP 服务器已运行 (默认端口 18792) 2. 输入与 OpenClaw 配置相同的 Gateway Token 3. 点击\"立即授权\"或点击扩展图标进行授权 4. 授权后 24 小时内自动控制浏览器，无需重复授权 连接地址 HTTP: http://127.0.0.1:18792/ WebSocket: ws://127.0.0.1:18792/extension"}],"timestamp":1772035170615}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b9f725c","parentId":"c99082c5","timestamp":"2026-02-25T15:59:37.399Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                              让我检查MCP服务器的WebSocket端点配置。根据说明，WebSocket应该在 `/extension` 路径，让我检查MCP服务器的代码："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7bc61fc26f31483b84d2143a","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\claw-browser-mcp\\src\\index.ts","offset":1,"limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":89178,"output":85,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89263,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772035170625}}
{"type":"message","id":"f7b539e0","parentId":"4b9f725c","timestamp":"2026-02-25T15:59:37.415Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7bc61fc26f31483b84d2143a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import express from \"express\";\nimport cors from \"cors\";\nimport { createServer } from \"http\";\nimport { Server } from \"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/index.js\";\nimport { StdioServerTransport } from \"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/stdio.js\";\nimport { CallToolRequestSchema, ListToolsRequestSchema } from \"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/types.js\";\nimport { tools } from \"./tools.js\";\n\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 18792;\n\nconst app = express();\napp.use(cors());\napp.use(express.json());\n\napp.get(\"/health\", (req, res) => {\n  res.json({ status: \"ok\", tools: tools.map(t => t.name) });\n});\n\napp.get(\"/tools\", (req, res) => {\n  res.json({ tools });\n});\n\n// 直接返回工具列表，告诉用户如何连接\napp.listen(PORT, () => {\n  console.log(`ClawBrowser MCP: http://127.0.0.1:${PORT}`);\n  console.log(``);\n  console.log(`请确保：`);\n  console.log(`1. 扩展已授权 (24小时有效)`);\n  console.log(`2. 点击扩展图标 attach 到任意页面`);\n  console.log(``);\n  console.log(`MCP 通过 stdio 与 OpenClaw 通信`);\n});\n\n// MCP Stdio\nasync function startMCP() {\n  const transport = new StdioServerTransport();\n  const mcp = new Server(\n    { name: \"claw-browser-mcp\", version: \"1.0.0\" },\n    { capabilities: { tools: {} } }\n  );\n\n  mcp.setRequestHandler(ListToolsRequestSchema, async () => {\n    return { tools: tools.map(t => ({ name: t.name, description: t.description, inputSchema: t.inputSchema })) };\n  });\n\n  mcp.setRequestHandler(CallToolRequestSchema, async (request) => {\n    const { name, arguments: args } = request.params;\n    const params = args as any || {};\n    console.log(`[MCP] ${name}`, params);\n\n\n[38 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772035177404}}
{"type":"message","id":"39d34355","parentId":"f7b539e0","timestamp":"2026-02-25T15:59:45.170Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                             我看到问题了！这个MCP服务器只有HTTP端点，没有WebSocket服务器。扩展需要WebSocket连接，但代码中只创建了HTTP服务器。\n\n让我检查MCP服务器是否需要创建WebSocket服务器。首先查看完整的startMCP函数："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f4df836d7acb48f39522aa16","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\claw-browser-extension\\background.js","offset":80,"limit":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":89724,"output":105,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89829,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772035177415}}
