{"type":"message","id":"4ef28a21","parentId":"8ab6c416","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:23:06.784Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"02033241-8d26-4674-b9de-1b7857e94f3a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Thu 2026-02-26 00:23 GMT+8] 但这个新插件 多了几个能力，第一一次授权24小时有效，你原生插件是每个标签页要点一次授权；第二这个新的插件可以通过自然语言对收藏夹进行管理，包括不仅限于要求充分分类，找到需要的收藏链接，重命名，编辑，删除，排序等"}],"timestamp":1772036586771}}
{"type":"message","id":"72f7f573","parentId":"4ef28a21","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:23:53.992Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王，你说得对！这个新的claw-browser插件确实有几个重要优势：\n\n## 🎯 核心优势对比\n\n### 🔄 授权机制\n- **原生扩展**: 每个标签页都需要单独授权 ⚠️\n- **claw-browser**: 一次授权，24小时有效 ✅\n\n### 📚 收藏夹管理  \n- **原生扩展**: 基本浏览器控制 ❌\n- **claw-browser**: 完整的自然语言书签管理 ✅\n\n### 🛠️ 功能对比\n```markdown\n| 功能 | 原生扩展 | claw-browser |\n|------|----------|-------------|\n| 24小时授权 | ❌ | ✅ |\n| 书签搜索 | ❌ | ✅ |\n| 书签分类 | ❌ | ✅ |  \n| 自动整理 | ❌ | ✅ |\n| 自然语言控制 | ❌ | ✅ |\n```\n\n## 🚀 立即解决方案\n\n让我修复连接问题，确保claw-browser插件正常工作：\n\n1. **移除所有前置检查** - 让扩展直接连接\n2. **优化WebSocket处理** - 完全兼容原生协议  \n3. **确保token验证** - 使用正确的Gateway Token\n\nclaw-browser一旦正常工作，将提供远超原生扩展的能力！ 💪"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":97415,"output":274,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97689,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772036586780}}
{"type":"message","id":"0f092193","parentId":"72f7f573","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:24:49.557Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"a962944d-54ce-4df3-baf8-a0f1650d407f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Thu 2026-02-26 00:24 GMT+8] 还有这个标签页可以对浏览器里面操控的权限更大，可以实现完全管理浏览器，所以你需要既要集成原有浏览器的简单认证，对接。又要让新功能能流畅使用"}],"timestamp":1772036689541}}
{"type":"message","id":"0604d9c2","parentId":"0f092193","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:25:12.618Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                大王说得对！这个新的claw-browser插件确实提供了更强大的浏览器控制能力。让我同时解决两个需求：\n\n## 🎯 双模式集成方案\n\n### 1. **保持原生兼容性**\n- ✅ 维持现有的WebSocket连接协议\n- ✅ 支持原生扩展的认证方式  \n- ✅ 确保现有功能不受影响\n\n### 2. **启用增强功能**\n- ✅ 添加书签管理API\n- ✅ 实现自然语言控制\n- ✅ 提供完整的浏览器操控\n\n## 🔧 立即实施\n\n让我修改MCP服务器，同时支持两种模式：\n\n1. **WebSocket协议兼容** - 保持与原扩展的兼容\n2. **增强功能暴露** - 通过新的工具提供高级功能\n\n修改MCP服务器代码，添加书签管理功能"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d444d8b13694486e9556eb2e","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\claw-browser-mcp\\src\\tools.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":97815,"output":214,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98029,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772036689552}}
{"type":"message","id":"a2398dc6","parentId":"0604d9c2","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:25:12.648Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d444d8b13694486e9556eb2e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import { ToolDefinition } from \"./types.js\";\n\nexport const tools: ToolDefinition[] = [\n  // ========== 书签管理 ==========\n  {\n    name: \"claw_get_bookmarks\",\n    description: \"获取浏览器所有书签（扁平列表）\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {},\n      required: []\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_get_bookmark_tree\",\n    description: \"获取浏览器书签树形结构\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {},\n      required: []\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_search_bookmarks\",\n    description: \"搜索书签（支持标题和URL关键词）\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        query: { type: \"string\", description: \"搜索关键词\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"query\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_open_bookmark\",\n    description: \"根据关键词打开书签（模糊匹配标题或URL）\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        keyword: { type: \"string\", description: \"书签关键词\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"keyword\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_create_bookmark_folder\",\n    description: \"创建新的书签文件夹\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        folderName: { type: \"string\", description: \"文件夹名称\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"folderName\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_delete_bookmark\",\n    description: \"删除指定书签\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        bookmarkId: { type: \"string\", description: \"书签ID\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"bookmarkId\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_move_bookmark\",\n    description: \"移动书签到指定文件夹\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        bookmarkId: { type: \"string\", description: \"书签ID\" },\n        newParentId: { type: \"string\", description: \"目标文件夹ID\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"bookmarkId\", \"newParentId\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_categorize_bookmark\",\n    description: \"将书签批量分类到指定文件夹（根据关键词匹配）\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        keywords: { \n          type: \"array\", \n          items: { type: \"string\" }, \n          description: \"分类关键词数组\" \n        },\n        folderName: { type: \"string\", description: \"目标文件夹名称（不存在则创建）\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"keywords\", \"folderName\"]\n    }\n  },\n  // ========== 页面操作 ==========\n  {\n    name: \"claw_navigate\",\n    description: \"打开指定网址\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        url: { type: \"string\", description: \"目标网址\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"url\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_click_element\",\n    description: \"点击页面元素（通过 CSS 选择器）\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        selector: { type: \"string\", description: \"CSS 选择器\" },\n        tabId: { type: \"number\", description: \"目标标签页 ID（可选）\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"selector\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_fill_input\",\n    description: \"在输入框填写内容\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        selector: { type: \"string\", description: \"输入框 CSS 选择器\" },\n        text: { type: \"string\", description: \"填写内容\" },\n        tabId: { type: \"number\", description: \"目标标签页 ID（可选）\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"selector\", \"text\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_execute_script\",\n    description: \"在页面执行 JavaScript 代码\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        code: { type: \"string\", description: \"JavaScript 代码\" },\n        tabId: { type: \"number\", description: \"目标标签页 ID（可选）\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"code\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_take_screenshot\",\n    description: \"截取当前页面截图\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        tabId: { type: \"number\", description: \"目标标签页 ID（可选）\" }\n      },\n      required: []\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_get_page_content\",\n    description: \"获取页面内容\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        mode: { \n          type: \"string\", \n          enum: [\"text\", \"html\"], \n          description: \"获取模式：text 或 html\" \n        },\n        tabId: { type: \"number\", description: \"目标标签页 ID（可选）\" }\n      },\n      required: []\n    }\n  },\n  // ========== 登录管理 ==========\n  {\n    name: \"claw_save_credentials\",\n    description: \"保存网站登录信息（本地加密存储）\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        domain: { type: \"string\", description: \"网站域名（如 zhihu.com）\" },\n        username: { type: \"string\", description: \"账号\" },\n        password: { type: \"string\", description: \"密码\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"domain\", \"username\", \"password\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_auto_login\",\n    description: \"自动登录到指定网站\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        domain: { type: \"string\", description: \"网站域名\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"domain\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_get_stored_logins\",\n    description: \"获取已保存的登录信息列表\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {},\n      required: []\n    }\n  },\n  // ========== 标签页管理 ==========\n  {\n    name: \"claw_get_tabs\",\n    description: \"获取所有标签页\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {},\n      required: []\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_close_tab\",\n    description: \"关闭指定标签页\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: \"object\",\n      properties: {\n        tabId: { type: \"number\", description: \"标签页 ID\" }\n      },\n      required: [\"tabId\"]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"claw_switch_tab\",\n    description: \"切换到指定标签页\",\n    inputSchema: {\n      type: 